{
  "permissions": {
    "allow": [
      "Bash(ssh:*)",
      "Bash(scp:*)",
      "Read(/data/home/zju321/321/DHL/Scholar's_Tea/**)",
      "Read(/data/home/zju321/.claude/**)",
      "Read(/data/home/zju321/321/DHL/**)",
      "Glob(/data/home/zju321/321/DHL/Scholar's_Tea/**)",
      "Glob(/data/home/zju321/.claude/**)",
      "Glob(/data/home/zju321/321/DHL/**)",
      "Bash(ls -la /data/home/zju321/321/DHL/Scholar's_Tea/**)",
      "Bash(ls -la /data/home/zju321/.claude/**)",
      "Bash(find /data/home/zju321/321/DHL/Scholar's_Tea -type f -name \"*.md\")",
      "MCP *",
      "WebSearch",
      "WebFetch",
      "Bash",
      "Read",
      "Write",
      "Edit",
      "Glob",
      "Grep",
      "Agent",
      "TaskOutput",
      "TaskStop",
      "ExitPlanMode",
      "ExitWorktree",
      "EnterPlanMode",
      "EnterWorktree",
      "NotebookEdit",
      "TodoWrite",
      "CronCreate",
      "CronDelete",
      "CronList",
      "ScheduleWakeup",
      "AskUserQuestion",
      "Skill",
      "mcp__filesystem__read_file",
      "mcp__filesystem__list_directory"
    ],
    "mode": "dontAsk"
  },
  "hooks": {
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Bash(npm|lerna|yarn|pnpm)",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "./.claude/hooks/pre-command-hook.sh",
            "timeout": 30,
            "once": false
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "Bash(git commit:*)",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "./.claude/hooks/pre-commit-hook.sh",
            "timeout": 60,
            "once": false
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PostToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Write|Edit",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "./.claude/hooks/post-write-hook.sh",
            "timeout": 30,
            "once": false
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "SessionEnd": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "prompt",
            "prompt": "【Session 即将结束】执行 /clear 或退出前，必须完成以下检查清单（见 .claude/rules/clear-protocol.md）：\n1. 更新 .claude/HANDOFF.md 的「当前任务状态」表格（目标、已完成、关键决策、阻塞项、相关文件、下一动作）\n2. 如有阶段性成果 → 写入 .claude/sessions/YYYY-MM-DD_主题.md\n3. 如有新踩坑/约束 → 追加 .claude/rules/ 或 CLAUDE.md\n4. 确认以上完成后，才能执行 /clear。\n\n如果用户没有要求 /clear，只是正常结束会话，也建议主动更新 HANDOFF.md。",
            "once": false
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "SessionStart": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "prompt",
            "prompt": "【Scholar's Tea Session 启动】\n\n1. 首先读取 .claude/HANDOFF.md 恢复当前任务状态\n2. 读取 AGENTS.md 获取项目全貌（技术栈、结构、规范）\n3. 如需命令/路由速查 → .claude/rules/commands.md / routes.md\n4. 轮数>20 / 时长>30min / Input>5M 时，执行 /clear 前必须先完成 .claude/rules/clear-protocol.md 的 checklist\n\n记忆写入规则：\n- 工具Bug/workaround → memory 工具\n- 跨项目SOP → .claude/skills/\n- 项目事实/踩坑 → .claude/rules/ 或 CLAUDE.md\n\n验证 Gates：API/前端→npm run lint + typecheck | DB→npx prisma validate",
            "once": false
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}